osts less at $199 but has a stop.\n- **Hotel: Midtown Lodge (H1)**, New York, checking in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, $378 total (reservation R0003). This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n\n**What went wrong along the way:** The first booking attempt timed out. When I retried, the system said the flight had been booked and charged ($289, reservation R0001) but the hotel booking had failed. I cancelled that partial flight booking, which refunded the $289, and then booked the trip again in full. I checked Dana's reservations afterwards: R0001 is cancelled, and only R0002 and R0003 are active, so nothing was booked or charged twice.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0132LdcjzDKovwnoViVpvQE8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01K5XtMSHV7SnEPzc4JTgNhj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: 289 + 378 = $667, under $1000.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_016osY84QNgipXvjhDzzddzV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Hy6UFQPBUKhGRPaYqTjgM5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool